{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060262/block/singleImage/3248269/df/1630915587_1e.jpg?updatedAt=1792981642\"/><figcaption>珍惜生命｜上水寶石湖邨28歲男墮樓 送院搶救</figcaption></figure><p>今日（26日）凌晨4時57分，警方接獲上水寶石湖邨珊瑚樓保安報案，指發現一名男子倒臥在上址對開。 人員接報到場，28歲姓鄧男子仍清醒，由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院救治。經初步調查，相信事主為上址住戶，從上址一平台墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，案件列作企圖自殺。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:37.362472+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:27:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:22.395220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:22.395220+00:00","content_hash":"d646653a570663e3007af72b93c2f9d0093106c3d179e31c1d10f4c37e7bec53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}